                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A delightful little puzzle game. Currently stuck on what I believe is the last level, which is just the way I like it. This game doesn't pull punches and really makes you have to think about your every move, but it does a good job of not making you too frustrated. Similar in idea to Quell, a mobile puzzle game I really enjoyed. There's also a hidden puzzle I found on accident, so keep an eye out for those!",
